### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8095
@keycloakUrl = http://localhost:8280
@realm = game_platform
@clientId = game-platform

###############################
### 1. Get Access Token (Admin)
###############################

POST {{keycloakUrl}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id={{clientId}}&username=johny&password=Test123&grant_type=password

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.access_token);
%}

###

### 2. Public Endpoint (No Auth Required)

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/health

###

### 3. Get User Profile (Authenticated)

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 4. Get All Users (Admin Only)

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 5. Manage Game (Game Developer Only)

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/games/manage
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "gameName": "Super Game",
  "version": "1.0.0"
}

###

### 6. Get Game Stats

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/games/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
